<view class="warn-banner">限制只拦"写"：被限制的账号不能新增、修改、删除记录，但可以正常查看。操作会记入操作记录。</view>
<view class="card">
  <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">脱敏编号</text><input class="form-val" placeholder="先在「账号查询」页确认编号" value="{{maskedId}}" bindinput="onId" /></view>
  <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">限制原因</text><input class="form-val" placeholder="限制时必填，如：异常刷量" value="{{reason}}" bindinput="onReason" /></view>
  <button class="btn-danger" bindtap="onRestrict" loading="{{busy}}">限制该账号记账</button>
  <button class="btn-ghost" bindtap="onUnrestrict" loading="{{busy}}">解除限制</button>
</view>
<view class="note">找不到编号时，先去「账号查询」按注册时间或编号片段查。</view>
